  "frontend": "A small pure applyWorkspaceDelta reducer is called through functional React setters. It normalizes only returned upserts, replaces complete authoritative records, applies removals and archives, and preserves unrelated object identity and pending edits. Optimistic board status/note ownership is preserved. Successful saves do not refetch app-state; uncertain writes can resync without retrying the write.",
